cation</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>[trp_language language=\"en_GB\"]Receive care from experienced specialists at our partner hospital while enjoying a restful holiday and attentive post-treatment follow-up.[/trp_language][trp_language language=\"de_DE\"]Betreuung durch erfahrene Fach\u00e4rzte in unserem Partnerkrankenhaus \u2013 verbunden mit einem erholsamen Urlaub und einer aufmerksamen Nachsorge.[/trp_language][trp_language language=\"tr_TR\"]Partner hastanemizdeki deneyimli uzmanlardan bak\u0131m al\u0131rken dinlendirici bir tatilin ve \u00f6zenli tedavi sonras\u0131 takibin keyfini \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131n.[/trp_language]</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Travel Journey\"},\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"ext-section is-style-ext-preset\\u002d\\u002dgroup\\u002d\\u002dnatural-1\\u002d\\u002dsection has-custom-css\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"},\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|55\"}},\"backgroundColor\":\"background\",\"layout\":{\"inherit\":true,\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull ext-section is-style-ext-preset--group--natural-1--section has-custom-css has-background-background-color has-background\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)\"><!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Section Intro\"},\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"ext-section-intro is-style-ext-preset\\u002d\\u002dgroup\\u002d\\u002dnatural-1\\u002d\\u002dsection-intro-1 has-custom-css\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide ext-section-intro is-style-ext-preset--group--natural-1--section-intro-1 has-custom-cs